<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:44 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Pantera Capital 支持的初创公司 Fission 筹集了 1000 万美元，帮助投资者更快地从代币化基金中套现</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/15/pantera-capital-backed-startup-fission-10-million-investors-tokenized-funds-liquidity/</link><description>Fission 由 Point72 和 Securitize 资深人士创立，其目标客户是华尔街代币化热潮中缺失的买家。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/image-4-2.png?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/15/pantera-capital-backed-startup-fission-10-million-investors-tokenized-funds-liquidity/</guid></item><item><title>“他不能再跑了”：MAGA 商品卖家正在关闭商店并降价。其中一家卖了 6300 万美元，但现在她关闭了 3 家商店</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/trump-maga-merch-sales-sellers-midterms-rallies-election/</link><description>在特朗普竞选期间，MAGA 商品蓬勃发展，但卖家正在关闭商店、大幅降价，并想知道他们的生意是否能比他更长久。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/81386411192__7614685C-DB10-406E-B609-69EE32295CEA-e1792181788485.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:36:43 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/trump-maga-merch-sales-sellers-midterms-rallies-election/</guid></item><item><title>11 届 WNBA 全明星 Nneka Ogwumike 警告称，球员正面临来自预测市场用户“刻薄”的安全威胁</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/wnba-player-threats-prediction-market-users/</link><description>“对于运动员来说，这不是一个安全的地方，”WNBA 球员协会主席奥格武迈克告诉《财富》杂志。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55588493885_413c23149a_o-e1791998706458.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:59:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/wnba-player-threats-prediction-market-users/</guid></item><item><title>美国债务超过40万亿美元，国际货币基金组织总裁警告称，仅靠经济增长并不能解决问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/imf-chief-kristalina-georgieva-warns-us-national-debt-economic-growth-not-enough-scott-bessent-treasury-deficit/</link><description>财政部长斯科特·贝森特表示，美国可以通过增长摆脱债务。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2299440419-e1792187140145.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 21:57:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/imf-chief-kristalina-georgieva-warns-us-national-debt-economic-growth-not-enough-scott-bessent-treasury-deficit/</guid></item><item><title>ServiceNow 首席财务官表示，领导者工作 14 小时，睡眠 4 小时，为员工树立了“可怕的榜样”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/servicenow-cfo-says-leaders-rest-work-life-balance-athletes/</link><description>ServiceNow 总裁兼首席财务官 Gina Mastantuono 表示：“恢复是业绩的一部分。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55586985002_9f81b69eab_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:02:49 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/servicenow-cfo-says-leaders-rest-work-life-balance-athletes/</guid></item><item><title>Lumen 首席执行官表示，董事会不再因为正确而获得奖励，这意味着高管合作伙伴关系比以往任何时候都更加重要</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/ceo-collaboration-uncertainty-lumen-technologies-ey/</link><description>“我们必须提出强烈的意见。我们必须掌握所有必须掌握的事实，而这在当今的市场上是不可能的，”凯特·约翰逊说。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55588579420_e1a035bf90_o-e1792022679616.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:53:26 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/ceo-collaboration-uncertainty-lumen-technologies-ey/</guid></item><item><title>财富管理高管表示，124万亿美元的巨大财富转移和女性的赚钱能力创造了一场“完美风暴”的机会</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/124-trillion-great-wealth-transfer-womens-earning-power-created-perfect-storm-of-opportunity-wealth-execs-say/</link><description>目前，大约 53% 的女性资产没有由专业顾问管理。财富管理高管表示，女性需要掌控自己的财务未来。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55588072564_32e25cc26f_o-e1792182854355.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 22:36:38 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/124-trillion-great-wealth-transfer-womens-earning-power-created-perfect-storm-of-opportunity-wealth-execs-say/</guid></item><item><title>凯蒂·扎卡里亚 (Katie Zacharia) 担任白宫新闻秘书的任期为五天，相当于斯卡拉穆奇的一半</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/white-house-press-secretary-katie-zacharia-lawyer/</link><description>她说，律师考试失败“有点无关紧要”，因为她在中国不需要成为一名被禁止的律师。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/AP26288032721349-e1792173545582.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 18:06:09 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/white-house-press-secretary-katie-zacharia-lawyer/</guid></item><item><title>“接近于零”：人工智能负责人考虑“政治项目”以及应对人工智能的真正变革水平</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/15/close-to-zero-ai-transformation-politics-projects/</link><description>在《财富》杂志的一次活动上，埃森哲、AXA、万事达卡和 Mistral AI 的高管表示，这项技术并不是人工智能收益的主要障碍。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2250640729.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 15 Oct 2026 18:02:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/15/close-to-zero-ai-transformation-politics-projects/</guid></item><item><title>对于一家杂货连锁店来说，生菜的运输成本现在高于生菜本身，这表明高燃油价格对整个经济产生了多大的影响</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/fuel-prices-diesel-costs-inflation-trucking-freight-surcharges-consumers/</link><description>“天然气价格上涨开始产生影响，因为与今年早些时候不同，这次财政政策没有抵消影响。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2295761544-e1792156924168.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 16 Oct 2026 16:39:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/16/fuel-prices-diesel-costs-inflation-trucking-freight-surcharges-consumers/</guid></item></channel></rss>